    "Finder 传入文件和音乐库副本各占一份空间。清理前会核对两份内容；清理后仍可播放音乐库中的副本。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transferred files and library copies use separate storage. Both copies are verified before cleanup; library audio remains playable."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Finder 传入文件和音乐库副本各占一份空间。清理前会核对两份内容；清理后仍可播放音乐库中的副本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
