    "从一首歌、一张专辑开始。导入你的音乐，慢慢收藏，随时聆听。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start with a song or an album. Import your music, build your collection, and listen anytime."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从一首歌、一张专辑开始。导入你的音乐，慢慢收藏，随时聆听。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
